; form-cli-allowance-birth.fk — BML names the add; JIT births it.
;
; Yes was surprised the 5 was Form-CPU and JIT sat quiet. It sat quiet
; because we never asked metal_pipeline / metal_enqueue. BML is not a
; second binary — it is this section: lhs 2, rhs 3, expect 5.
;
; Authority is this section. Crystallize with form-cli-allowance-birth-compile.fk.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk
; Proven by: form-stdlib/tests/form-cli-allowance-birth-band.fk
; witnessed: 2026-08-20 -> 255

(do (defn alb-lhs () 2) (defn alb-rhs () 3) (defn alb-expect () 5) (defn alb-bml () (add (alb-lhs) (alb-rhs))) (defn alb-check () (add (if (eq (alb-lhs) 2) 1 0) (add (if (eq (alb-rhs) 3) 2 0) (add (if (eq (alb-expect) 5) 4 0) (if (eq (alb-bml) 5) 8 0))))) 0)
